OL,3,ANetanyahu defends Israeli military as
OL,4,Adelegates walk out before UN speech
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsraeli Prime Minister Benjamin
OL,7,FNetanyahu has fiercely defended his
OL,8,Fcountry's military campaigns in Iran,
OL,9,FGaza and elsewhere in the Middle East
OL,10,Fin a speech to the UN General Assembly.
OL,12,FAfter dozens of delegates walked out in
OL,13,Fprotest as he took to the stage,
OL,14,FNetanyahu vowed to continue fighting:
OL,15,F"We're going to win. We have no other
OL,16,Fchoice."
OL,18,FIn response to the walkout, he said:
OL,19,F"If there are any other moral cowards
OL,20,Fwho haven't left the hall, please do so
OL,21,Fnow."
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
